<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello,</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Your approval is requested for a Misc Adjustment <b>{!pse__Miscellaneous_Adjustment__c.Name}</b>, on Project&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;"><b>{!pse__Miscellaneous_Adjustment__c.pse__Project__c}.</b></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><b><br></b></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Submitted By:</b>&nbsp;{!pse__Miscellaneous_Adjustment__c.CreatedBy}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Here is some additional information about the request, for you to make your decision:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Description:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!pse__Miscellaneous_Adjustment__c.pse__Description__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Reason:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!pse__Miscellaneous_Adjustment__c.Reason__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Amount:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!pse__Miscellaneous_Adjustment__c.pse__Amount__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Additional Comments:</b>&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!ApprovalRequest.Comments}&nbsp;</span></div><div style=""><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">To view and Approve/Reject click on the below link:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="" color="#3333ff">{!pse__Miscellaneous_Adjustment__c.Link}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">If you have any questions, please contact the person who submitted the request.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
